  "— always use it —": "始终使用",
  "— never fires on a window —": "不由时机触发",
  "— pick one: $w bindings stay unnamed until you do —": "请选择一个时机，以确定 $w 变量的含义",
  "—choose—": "请选择",
  "…or a URL, or a card code to reuse that card's art": "或填写图片网址、现有卡牌编号以复用卡图",
  "Bonded cards start outside the deck and come with this one. A cost that searches your bonded cards is what puts them in.": "绑定卡牌随此卡携带，初始不在牌组内，通过搜索绑定卡牌的费用将其加入。",
  "Build the cards first and they will be listed here to pick from.": "请先创建卡牌，之后即可在此选择。",
  "A Let step can bind a query directly, which is how new ones are written. This still works; there is nothing to fix here.": "赋值步骤现在可以直接保存查询结果。此旧式写法仍可运行，无需修改。",
  "A requirement only compares bindings, so it can gate on where the card is. Use it rather than": "限制条件只比较变量，也可以检查卡牌所在位置。在收集修正时，请用此条件代替",
  "And what it does only if you then succeed — success is not known when the token resolves, so these run when the test is passed:": "之后检定成功时执行：标记结算时尚不知道结果，以下步骤在检定成功后执行。",
  "Applies while this card is in play, to everything the matcher selects. Match": "此卡在场时，对所有符合条件的对象生效。选择",
  "Asks once, splitting a total between investigators, and runs the steps below on each share. The answer comes back as its own message, so those steps see the card's own bindings and the two this block makes — not what earlier steps in this run bound.": "询问一次，将总量分配给调查员，对每份分配执行以下步骤。回应是独立消息，只能使用此卡自身变量及此处新建的两个变量，不能使用前面步骤的变量。",
  "Engine messages this card reacts to directly, for effects that no ability window covers.": "直接响应引擎消息，适用于没有对应能力触发时机的效果。",
  "Evade an enemy. The test it starts is": "躲避一名敌人，对应检定变量为",
  "Fight an enemy. Whether the card itself is a fight action comes from its Actions, not from here — this is the attack it makes.": "与敌人战斗。卡牌是否具有战斗行动由其行动设置决定，此处仅定义攻击效果。",
  "Fires when a message with this tag mentions this card — by its target, its source or its id. The whole message is": "当指定消息的目标、来源或编号提及此卡时触发，完整消息保存在",
  "Investigate, the way the action does. The test it starts is": "按调查行动的方式调查，对应检定变量为",
  "Mark a checkbox on an upgrade sheet for a customizable card you own — pick the card and which customization, and answer whatever that customization asks for.": "在你拥有的可定制卡牌升级表上勾选一格：选择卡牌和定制项目，再填写该项目要求的信息。",
  "Mentioning this card is not the same as being about it — an enemy someone else defeated still names this card if it was the target. A requirement pins down which field has to be this card, the way a hand-written card matches on its source.": "消息提及此卡不等于事件属于此卡。例如其他调查员击败的敌人若以此卡为目标，也可能提及此卡。请添加限制条件，明确哪个字段必须与此卡相符。",
  "Now runs for every message with this tag, so gate it with a requirement below (an id from the message compared against one of this card's, say) or it will fire for everyone.": "现在会响应所有同类消息。请添加限制条件，例如比较消息中的编号与此卡编号，否则其他角色的事件也会触发。",
  "Offers the cards you could play, paying the cost, each shown as the card itself. A discount is worked out before the choice, since a card is only playable if you can afford it. Naming a card plays that one instead of offering a choice; free skips payment entirely, for \"without paying its cost\".": "列出可支付费用打出的卡牌，选择后支付费用。减免在选择前计算；指定卡牌则直接打出该卡；勾选不支付费用会跳过付款。",
  "One option per thing the matcher finds, with it bound for the steps below.": "每个匹配对象生成一个选项，所选对象保存为变量供后续步骤使用。",
  "Only they can take it, and their id is bound as": "仅该调查员可以携带，其编号保存为",
  "for this card's abilities. The link lives on their signatures, so add or remove it there.": "供此卡能力使用。关联关系在调查员的专属卡牌列表中设置，请在那里增删。",
  "Parley against something. Unlike the others there is no action to derive the test from, so the target, skill and difficulty are all named here. The test is": "与目标谈判。此处需明确目标、检定属性与难度，对应检定变量为",
  "Resolves one of this card's own abilities, offered the way using it normally would be so its cost is paid. Abilities are numbered from 1, in the order they are written.": "结算此卡的一项能力，照常选择并支付费用。能力编号按编写顺序从 1 开始。",
  "Runs the matcher; takes the first branch when it finds anything.": "检查匹配条件，找到对象时执行第一个分支。",
  "Runs the steps below only when the matcher finds something.": "仅找到匹配对象时执行以下步骤。",
  "Runs the steps below only while a skill test is being resolved, with that test bound for them. Nothing happens when there is no test.": "仅正在结算技能检定时执行以下步骤，并保存检定变量。没有检定时不执行。",
  "Runs the steps below over and over. \"A total of 8 resources, distributed as you wish\" is eight passes of choosing who gets one, which is how the engine plays it.": "重复执行以下步骤。例如任意分配 8 个资源，可以执行 8 次，每次选择一位调查员获得 1 个资源。",
  "Runs the steps below where something is, with that location bound for them. Nothing happens when it is nowhere.": "取得对象所在地点，保存地点变量并执行以下步骤。对象没有所在地点时不执行。",
  "Runs the steps once per thing found, with it bound below.": "对每个匹配对象执行一次以下步骤，并保存该对象变量。",
  "Shuffles a card into the encounter deck. \"Gather during setup\" is over by the time a card in play can act, so this is the nearest a card can get to it.": "将卡牌混洗入遭遇牌库。卡牌在场时已过准备阶段，无法重新执行准备时的收集卡牌流程，可用此效果加入卡牌。",
  "Some messages are answered by another message a turn of the game later —": "部分请求会在游戏流程稍后通过另一条消息回应，例如",
  ". Every one of them sends the answer back by source or target, which is this card, so the answer is handled here beside the question rather than in a handler of its own.": "。回应通过来源或目标回到此卡，因此在请求下方处理回应，无需单独创建监听规则。",
  "Stops the thing this ability is reacting to, for effects that say \"instead\". Only works in a": "取消正在响应的事件，用于改为执行其他效果。仅适用于",
  "window, which is what carries the batch to cancel — and only cancels what that batch holds, so anything else the card means to do it must push itself.": "时机，只取消该批次包含的事件。需要执行的其他效果必须自行添加步骤。",
  "Swaps only when the test would have used that skill, and can be declined by anything that ignores the substitution — the difference between \"uses willpower\" and \"uses willpower instead of intellect\".": "仅当检定原本使用该属性时才替代，且可能被忽略属性替代的效果阻止。这与直接指定检定属性不同。",
  "Take one immediate action as if it were your turn.": "立即执行一次行动，如同处于你的回合。",
  "The enemy's own attack ability, granted so it costs no action. No card can be a basic fight action, so modifiers \"for this attack\" have nowhere to go here.": "使用敌人的基础战斗能力，不花费行动。此方式不属于此卡自身的战斗能力，无法在这里附加本次攻击修正。",
  "The first branch whose condition holds.": "执行首个条件成立的分支。",
  "The source is this card and the modifiers carry no card of their own, so only what is modified, for how long, and with what are asked for. Left alone, the window is the skill test being resolved — what \"+2 for this test\" means.": "修正来源是此卡，只需指定对象、持续时间和修正内容。默认持续时间为当前正在结算的技能检定。",
  "Their signature cards replace the ones the deck's investigator brought.": "新调查员的专属卡牌会替换原调查员的专属卡牌。",
  "This card attacks whoever triggered the ability — \"it makes an immediate attack against you\".": "此卡攻击触发能力的调查员，即立即对你进行一次攻击。",
  "What happens the moment it is drawn, before anything can react to the reveal — where a flag this card's own abilities read has to be set:": "抽到标记的瞬间执行，早于对揭示的响应。需要供本卡能力读取的状态标记应在此设置：",
  "What the card makes you do beyond paying its cost, checked and taken as part of playing it — spend an action, add curse tokens, shuffle bonded cards into your deck.": "打出此卡时除支付费用外还需完成的事项，例如花费行动、加入诅咒标记或将绑定卡牌混洗入牌库。",
  ", so a modifier \"for this investigation\" goes in the box below or is pushed against that.": "，本次调查的修正可填在下方，或以该变量为目标添加。",
  "bindings. The ability is reached another way — an elder sign, or another card's Use an ability step.": "变量。此能力通过其他方式调用，例如旧印或另一张卡牌的使用能力步骤。",
  "fires on more than one window, so which fields": "可以在多个时机触发，因此变量字段",
  "fires on no window of its own, so there are no": "没有自身触发时机，因此没有",
  "is not something “": "不适用于“",
  "is their id, so \"Prey — them only\" is": "是所属调查员编号，仅以该调查员为猎物可设置为",
  "never fires on its own, so there are no": "不会自行触发，因此没有",
  "rather than an entity to reach a card before it is in play — that is what a keyword needs when the engine reads it at draw or spawn time.": "而非场上实体，可以匹配尚未入场的卡牌。这适用于抽到或生成时读取的关键词。",
  "when the question would ask for modifiers while modifiers are being collected.": "，避免在收集修正期间再次查询修正。",
  "” can be asked for.": "”的查询。",
  "… are depends on which. Its own are listed first.": "的含义取决于所选时机；优先列出自身的时机。",
  "… for what the answer carries. Not what earlier steps in this run bound — the answer is its own message.": "等回应携带的字段。回应是独立消息，不能使用之前步骤保存的变量。",
